      "id": "claim_2433395fad1a45f9bbc7fc1b065daaff",
      "statement": "The host/client boundary in dsh-pet-panel is an explicit RPC contract, not shared imports. The host side (src/index.ts) exposes four TypertRemoteService gateways (SkillForgeGateway, ToolIntegrationsGateway, A2AConfigGateway, TeamGateway) whose public methods are annotated with @Remote('<method>'); the client side (src/client/remote.ts) carries a hand-written TYPERT_REMOTE manifest mounted onto the Typert client remote via ctx.remote.$mount(TYPERT_REMOTE). Host methods are discovered at runtime by the api-gateway from the typertRemote binding plus the @Remote marker table in source mode, so no generated /typert artifact is required.",
